  :decided "PY6g's report (queue 200); PYI-SPEC.md §9 (the core types); its pow part (test_decimal's pow(int, Decimal, int)) cleared by PY7-runtime's 6b33abba (queue 201); queue 286 (narrowed: the formatting, the Unicode digits, the subclass getsets)"
